{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>והשיאו</b> — two times here, and the other: והשיאו כל ישראל אל העיר, regarding Absalom, on account of the counsel that Hushai gave him, advising him to his harm. This is: והשיאו אותם עון אשמה. Eleven times קדשים is mentioned in this passage (from איש איש מזרע אהרן, which speaks of תרומה, until כי אני ה' מקדשם — one is needed for itself), corresponding to the eleven distinctions between תרומה and קודש." "<b>באכלם</b> — two times here, and the other: באכלם מעבור הארץ — that eating תרומה in bodily impurity is a transgression."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:18.988192601Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}